 "paragraphs": [
  "They started to count again.",
  "They approached the flamingos when they finished. “We have 5 twigs and 2 shells, which is 52 crabs,” Aliya said.",
  "“Correct,” said one of the flamingos. “Now, you must cross the marsh and enter the cave to find the trio of bats. They will have your next riddle but remember, do not forget the total number of objects you have.”",
  "Zade carried the 6 shells from before. Aliya picked up the 5 twigs and the young falcon swept the 2 shells under his wing."
 ],
